          "definition": "The action domain is $[0,1]^d$. The Matern kernel $k_{\\nu,\\ell}$ and its RKHS are public, with $\\nu,\\ell>0$ and $k(x,x)=1$. The function sequence is fixed before interaction and satisfies $$\\|f_t\\|_{\\mathcal H_k}\\le B,\\qquad \\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\mathbf 1\\{f_t\\ne f_{t-1}\\}\\le S_{\\mathrm{seg}}-1,\\qquad 1\\le S_{\\mathrm{seg}}\\le T.$$."
